*** Bits and Bytes ***

Bits is 0 or 1

Bytes is = to 8 Bits

Speed is measured in bits per second (Kbps, Mbps, Gbps, etc.), not bytes per second.
1 Kilobit (Kb)  = 1,000 bits
1 megabit (Mb)  = 1,000,000 bits
1 gigabut (Gb)  = 1,000,000,000 bits
1 terabit (Tb)  = 1,000,000,000,000 Bits

